        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK6201, Manchester Lever Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the styling of traditional décor, DoralLock's Manchester Lever Trim Kit exemplifies how simple, classic designs can be truly beautiful. This traditional lever is made out of solid brass and is available in 7 finishes. The Manchester Lever Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-manchester-lever-dorallock-6200\">Manchester Lever Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK6201 Manchester Lever Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-/12\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK6201-specifications.pdf?v=1704262207\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK6201 Manchester Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
